    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like a ghost lately. everything is so fast now, so loud and digital... i look around and i don't even recognize the world anymore. it feels like my part of the story is already written and the pages are just turning without me. like i'm just a relic waiting to be cleared away.",
